# Revisions that moved code without changing it. `git blame` skips these so a
# line's blame lands on the commit that wrote its CONTENT, not the one that
# relocated it.
#
# Use locally with:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
# GitHub's blame view honours this file automatically.

